---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { personalData } from '../data/personal.js';
---

<Layout title="About — Aaditya Shah" description="About Aaditya Shah, his method, interests, and longer horizon.">
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content">
    <header class="page-hero">
      <div class="shell">
        <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
        <h1>A little about me.</h1>
        <p>I am Aaditya Shah, a second-year B.Tech student in Computer Science and Engineering at IIT Gandhinagar, graduating in 2029. I am drawn to difficult questions at the meeting point of mathematics, computation, and engineered systems.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="shell about-grid">
        <aside class="about-aside">
          <p class="eyebrow">Current focus</p>
          <p>Mathematical foundations<br />Enigma cryptanalysis<br />Computational complexity theory<br />Exploring quantum computing<br />Algorithms and data structures<br />Interactive systems as a medium<br />Design and collaboration<br />Philosophy of knowledge and mind</p>
        </aside>
        <div class="about-copy">
          <p class="about-lede">I use mathematics to understand a system, and programming to test whether that understanding holds.</p>
          <p>I entered IIT Gandhinagar in Mechanical Engineering and changed to Computer Science after my first semester. Since then, I have built Android apps, simulations, and interactive web experiences while moving toward research in mathematics and computation.</p>
          <p>Enigma cryptanalysis is my main research thread. Alongside it, I have started exploring computational complexity theory and, eventually, its intersection with quantum computing. I am also studying the mathematical foundations of quantum computing, learning algorithms more deliberately, and reading philosophy—especially questions about knowledge, consciousness, ethics, and what it means to understand something.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="work-title">
      <div class="shell">
        <header class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Research, contributions & leadership</p><h2 class="section-title" id="work-title">What I’ve been working on.</h2></div><a class="section-link" href="/projects/">All projects →</a></header>
        <dl class="profile-record">
          <div><dt><span class="meta">Research · SRIP 2026</span><a href="/projects/enigma-cryptanalysis/">Enigma cryptanalysis ↗</a></dt><dd>Modelled rotor recovery through permutations and group theory. Later analysis and simulations confirmed an additional spin ambiguity. The investigation continues beyond the summer internship.</dd></div>
          <div><dt><span class="meta">Open source · September–November 2026</span><a href="/projects/open-source-contributions/">Contributing to Qiskit & Cirq ↗</a></dt><dd>Fixed Qiskit’s angle wrapping inside control flow and added NumPy’s modern random-generator API to Cirq, with tests. Qiskit PR #17349 merged on 3 November. Cirq PR #8382 merged in September.</dd></div>
          <div><dt><span class="meta">Leadership · Blithchron 2027</span><a href="/projects/blithchron-website/">Design & Tech Coordinator ↗</a></dt><dd>Adapted Bruno Simon’s open-source work for the festival website, made major architecture decisions, and deployed the site in August 2026.</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="shell horizon">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">Long horizon</p><blockquote>The horizon is larger than software.</blockquote></div>
        <div class="horizon-copy">
          <p>Over time, I want to move closer to technologies that change what humans can understand or build—especially quantum systems, intelligence, energy, and computation that meets the physical world.</p>
          <p>This site is my working notebook: a place to record experiments, explain changed conclusions, and return to questions as I learn more.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="shell horizon">
        <blockquote>Working on something difficult?</blockquote>
        <div class="horizon-copy">
          <p>I am always glad to hear from people thinking carefully about mathematics, computation, research, or complex systems.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href={`mailto:${personalData.socialLinks.mail}`}>Write to me ↗</a><a class="button secondary" href={personalData.socialLinks.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
